{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bWmYNXZdBW1793668136.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港股料高開約百點，納指升轉跌1%、道指回升213點；特朗普否認考慮中期選舉後打擊伊朗，倫敦期油曾跌7%，人行等推出第三輪互換便利。</p><p></p><p><strong>港股料高開約百點</strong></p><p></p><p>港股開市料高開約百點。美股方面，納指由升轉跌1%，道指回升213點。個股方面，英特爾跌8%，Marvell跌12%，Lumentum跌18%。</p><p></p><p><strong>倫敦期油曾跌7%</strong></p><p></p><p>特朗普否認考慮在中期選舉後打擊伊朗，並可能達成協議；倫敦期油曾跌7%。美國中期選舉開始投票</p><p></p><p><strong>人行等推出第三輪互換便利</strong></p><p></p><p>人行等推出第三輪互換便利，股票回購增持再貸款利率降至1厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:42:27.486527+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T00:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T15:18:19.995585+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T01:39:03.273969+00:00","content_hash":"3116adbc5533cd03d8d826ce02e1d27a16a2973d8b0af1879329eafe4712b5f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:42:27.486527+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}